<title>LEBANON: Solidere shares mixed on lower turnover.</title>
<headline>Solidere shares mixed on lower turnover.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solidere shares were mixed on the Beirut Stock Exchange on Friday as A shares fell to $111.875 from $113.75 and B shares rose to $115.875 from $114.</p>
<p>Turnover was 4,745 shares from 5,656 on Thursday and value was $537,439 from $643,375.</p>
<p>There was no trade in the shares of the four other listed companies- Ciments Libanais, Ciments Blancs, Eternit and Uniceramic.</p>
<p>The LISPI stock index was unchanged at 82.46 and the BLOM stock index rose 0.88 percent to 958.6.</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (9611) 353078 645456 602057</p>
</text>
